      generatedFingerprint: cb54f99874c90e78520bed83edeef347
      generatedWavPath: Assets/GeneratedAudio/Dialogues/Slacking_intern_3167e74f/02_Scared_00_am_michael.wav
    - text: I am using the company AI to do some work in security...So its basically
